                                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2"></i>
                                            <strong>What encapsulation does:</strong>
                                            <ul class="mb-0">
                                                <li>✅ <strong>Private fields</strong> - Data is hidden and safe</li>
                                                <li>✅ <strong>Public properties</strong> - Controlled access with validation</li>
                                                <li>✅ <strong>Private setters</strong> - Only the class can change certain data</li>
                                                <li>✅ <strong>Read-only properties</strong> - Calculate values when needed</li>
                                                <li>✅ <strong>Public methods</strong> - Safe ways to change data</li>
